  - RFID UID
  - Games
  - Wins
  - Losses
  - Best Shot
  - Match History table

Match History table columns:
- Date
- Match
- Score
- Result
- Fastest Shot

Example:
21 Jun 2026 14:30 | Sara vs Ali | 5 - 3 | Win | 12.4 km/h

If the player is a guest:
- Show button: "Register This Player"
- Clicking it opens the register dialog for this player.

Part 11: Register dialog

Register dialog fields:
- RFID UID, read-only
- Current name, read-only
- New player name, input
- Cancel button
- Save button

On Save:
- Call POST /api/register-player
- Close register dialog
- Refresh:
  - players list
  - live match
  - profile dialog if it is still open

Important:
If Guest1 is registered as Sara, do not create a new player.
Update the existing Guest1 row.
All history must remain connected.

Part 12: JavaScript behavior

In static/script.js:
- Poll GET /api/live every 1 second.
- Poll GET /api/players every 3 seconds.
- Implement:
